    slug: 'yacht-closing-services',
    eyebrow: "Closing & Escrow",
    h1: "Yacht Closing & Transaction Services",
    title: "Yacht Closing & Transaction Services | FYI Yachts",
    description: "Buying a yacht involves navigating a maze of maritime laws, international flagging, and tax implications. Our closing team acts as your navigational…",
    intro: "Buying a yacht involves navigating a maze of maritime laws, international flagging, and tax implications. Our closing team acts as your navigational officers, ensuring every document is airtight and every transfer is…",
    inquiryContext: "Yacht closing services",
    sections: [
      { heading: "Seamless Execution", text: "Buying a yacht involves navigating a maze of maritime laws, international flagging, and tax implications. Our closing team acts as your navigational officers, ensuring every document is airtight and every transfer is secure. We handle the complexity so you can focus on the destination.\n\n- Global Flagging Strategy: Optimized registration for Delaware, BVI, Cayman, and beyond.\n- US Coast Guard Documentation: Full compliance and expedited processing.\n- Secure Escrow Services: Protected funds transfer with trusted intermediaries.\n- Duty & Tax Structuring: Strategic guidance to minimize liability." },
      { heading: "Secure Your Investment", text: "Ownership requires more than just maintenance; it demands protection. Access comprehensive coverage tailored for global cruising, including hull, machinery, and crew liability. We connect you with premier marine underwriters to ensure your asset is covered from Miami to the Med." },
      { heading: "How long does the closing process typically take?", text: "While industry standards often span 30-45 days, our streamlined internal process allows us to secure a closing in as little as 14-21 days, pending survey results and financing approval. We move at your pace, not the bank’s." },
      { heading: "Do I need to be physically present for the closing?", text: "Rarely. We facilitate secure digital closings and power-of-attorney executions, allowing you to finalize the acquisition from your office, home, or anywhere in the world." },
      { heading: "Can I structure the purchase for privacy?", text: "Absolutely. We specialize in UHNW asset protection and frequently coordinate closings through LLCs, trusts, or offshore corporate structures to maintain your confidentiality and limit liability." },
      { heading: "Can you handle international flagging and registration?", text: "Yes. Whether you require a US Coast Guard Document or a foreign flag (Cayman, BVI, Marshall Islands), our team navigates the specific maritime laws to optimize your tax position and operational needs." },
      { heading: "How are funds secured during the transaction?", text: "Your capital is fully protected. All deposits and final funds are held in a bonded, insured escrow account and are only released upon clear title verification and your explicit written authorization." },
      { heading: "Expert Title & Due Diligence", text: "We don’t outsource peace of mind. Our internal team conducts exhaustive background checks to ensure clear title, lien-free status, and full regulatory compliance before you sign." },
      { heading: "Accelerated Transaction Speed", text: "Time is the ultimate luxury. By managing the legal review and documentation in-house, we eliminate third-party delays—often cutting weeks off standard industry timelines." },
      { heading: "Total Privacy & Security", text: "We specialize in discreet UHNW transactions. From LLC formations to secure escrow services, your identity and financial details are protected by strict confidentiality protocols." },
      { heading: "Global Flagging Strategy", text: "Whether registering in Delaware, the Cayman Islands, or the BVI, we navigate international maritime laws to optimize your tax position and operational flexibility." },
      { heading: "Let’s Close The Deal", text: "Don’t let paperwork anchor your plans. Our closing specialists are ready to navigate the final nautical mile, ensuring a secure, swift, and seamless handover." },
    ],
